cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the preprint below."
title: "CPT/HCPCS procedure-code recommendation: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and benchmark harness for "CPT/HCPCS Code
  Recommendation from Clinical Notes: A Comparative Evaluation of AI Methods".
  Six systems - lexical retrieval, a long-document neural classifier, two
  prompted frontier-LLM configurations, a supervised fine-tune, and a staged
  retrieve-and-verify pipeline - evaluated across two clinical corpora.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sqyXIU/cpt-hcpcs-code-recommendation"
authors:
